{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal approach using weighted fusion instead of concatenation, keeping RNA and image encoders, aggregation, and profile setting unchanged. Validation accuracy of 0.5232 and F1 of 0.5084 slightly lag behind the baseline concatenation fusion (001), suggesting weighted fusion may not improve performance in this configuration. Uncertainty remains about the relative effectiveness of fusion strategies, as no other modalities or aggregation methods were compared."
}

